35
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:14,040
The Ancient God's desires

36
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:16,320
are beyond what ordinary people can endure.

37
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,840
But your constitution is special,

38
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,640
as long as you absorb it

39
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,880
your cultivation method will be complete.

40
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,640
If I absorb it,

41
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:26,160
will I be able to take you away with me ?

42
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,360
Of course.

43
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:34,040
We will use the Ancient God's power to leave this place

44
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:36,080
and escape Tuo Sen's control.

45
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:41,200
But this process will subject you to excruciating pain.

46
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,600
Disciple is willing !

47
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:54,440
Ancient God's bones ?

48
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:14,920
Let's go, Master will protect you during the process.

49
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:26,680
Master, you mustn't !

50
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:29,080
Don't ignite your own Divine Sense like that !

51
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,000
We don't have much time,

52
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:34,480
this is the fastest way to draw out the Ancient God's desires.

53
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:37,440
Use the Ancient God's bones to help you absorb desires.

54
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:38,440
Quick !

55
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:42,800
Master...

56
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:50,040
Something's wrong with this formation.

57
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,440
The Ancient God's desires....

58
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,520
Absorb !

59
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,800
The Life and Death hexagram ?

60
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:42,400
Sky Devil Magician is feigning weakness

61
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:45,640
but it's Six Desires Demon Lord that's on the Death position !

62
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:47,120
Could it be...

63
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,120
Master, I...

64
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,480
I succeeded...

65
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,960
Use bones as the guide...

66
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:29,880
Use desires as the sword...

67
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,560
Use the six desires of the Ancient God as the medium...

68
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:35,240
I sacrifice this person’s flesh and blood

69
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:36,640
for my own sake !

70
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:03,000
M... Master...

71
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:08,000
My dear disciple, Master's efforts in raising you weren't wasted.

72
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:52,080
4000 years ago, I was just a rogue cultivator.

73
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:56,080
I reached the Dead Soul Sea by chance.

74
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:58,920
Thanks to my cultivation technique based on desires,

75
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,920
I discovered the secret hidden here.

76
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,760
The Ancient God's memories !

77
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:08,360
This is a priceless opportunity that can only be found by chance !

78
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,680
I came here multiple times

79
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,200
and created the Mystic Heavenly Devil Desire Method.

80
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:16,720
It can use Ancient God Tu Si's six desires

81
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:19,480
to refine a memory inheritance crystal

82
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:22,960
and extract the Ancient God's memories.

83
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:29,000
But absorbing the Ancient God's six desires requires a special constitution.

84
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:31,640
I desperately looked for a vessel

85
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:34,400
until I found you.

86
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:37,240
I named you the Six Desires Devil Lord

87
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:40,080
and raised you meticulously.

88
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:43,520
Thankfully, you didn't disappoint me.

89
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:49,840
When I entered the Land of the Ancient God with you, I was caught off guard

90
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:53,360
and I accidentally discovered Tuo Sen's secret.

91
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:55,600
With no other choice,

92
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:57,600
I had to submit, hide here,

93
00:08:58,040 --> 00:09:00,360
and patiently wait for you.

94
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:04,720
You really didn't disappoint me.

95
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:12,200
I have waited far too long for this moment !

96
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,280
Why ?

97
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,920
From the beginning,

98
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:20,280
was I just a pawn in your plan ?

99
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:23,280
Why ?

100
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:25,960
I'll tell you.

101
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:30,680
Because only by obtaining the memory inheritance

102
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:33,120
can Master be reborn

103
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:35,560
and roam freely in this cultivation world !

104
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:40,400
And of course, because I'll be able to leave this place unharmed.

105
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:55,360
I, the Six Desires Devil Lord, call myself a Devil Lord.

106
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:59,160
In my life, I have refined countless puppets

107
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:01,200
and committed every conceivable evil.

108
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,560
It's ridiculous

109
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:09,440
that what made me fall was this poorly acted master-disciple relationship.

110
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,200
How pathetic...

111
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,720
How truly pathetic !

112
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:24,480
The Dao is merciless.

113
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,920
Obtaining the memory inheritance

114
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,160
is the only way out.

115
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:34,040
The gap in cultivation between me and the Sky Devil Magician is too wide,

116
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,000
I can't fight him head on.

117
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,440
I mustn't act recklessly...

118
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,840
Who is there ?

119
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:57,120
Duo Mu\NBlood Sea Warrior

120
00:10:58,600 --> 00:11:00,760
Junior pay respects to Lord Duo Mu

121
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,240
and to the other Warriors.

122
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:10,400
What is this thing ?

123
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:14,120
This crystal was refined by my disciple.

124
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:16,400
I took him as my disciple back then

125
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,440
in order to refine this crystal

126
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,520
and increase my cultivation.

127
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:22,480
My Lord, if you like it

128
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:24,520
then consider it Junior's gift to you.

129
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,000
Is that so ?

130
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,000
Pathetic.

131
00:11:36,280 --> 00:11:38,120
And I thought it was a real treasure.

132
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:39,600
This...

133
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:44,640
Fate really is unpredictable...

134
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:46,960
Since nothing's wrong here,

135
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:49,640
continue searching for the Soul Devourer.

136
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:55,760
A Soul Formation powerhouse

137
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:57,800
is nothing but an ant before him.

138
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:01,000
What level of cultivation does this person have ?

139
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:33,280
Members of the Ancient God Clan

140
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:35,400
are born from the stars.

141
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:38,120
The tradition of our clan

142
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:40,360
is to feed ourselves on planets.

143
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:43,440
We are the strongest race in the universe.

144
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:47,440
My name is Ancient God Tu Si.

145
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:50,080
Inheritor,

146
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:54,400
your memory inheritance is incomplete.

147
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:57,680
Even though Ancient Gods live long,

148
00:13:57,680 --> 00:13:59,720
we can still die of old age.

149
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:02,480
At the end of my lifespan,

150
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:06,120
I used a technique to preserve my Divine Sense and continue to cultivate.

151
00:14:06,520 --> 00:14:09,000
but I didn't expect to be attacked.

152
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:16,680
The demon Tuo Sen,

153
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:21,600
an inner demon I severed from my Sea of Consciousness in my youth,

154
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:25,200
obtained my inheritance of power.

155
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:30,760
I used my remaining Divine Sense to resist him

156
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:32,880
but I lost.

157
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:40,960
Tu Si,

158
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:43,480
now that you are dead,

159
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:44,520
I

160
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:46,320
am you !

161
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:51,520
Before I died and returned to the Dao,

162
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:54,320
I used the last of my strength

163
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:57,000
to split my Sea of Consciousness in two.

164
00:14:57,400 --> 00:15:01,080
I used the Blood Sea's Divine Sense to seal Tuo Sen

165
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:03,920
And the Dead Soul Sea's Divine Sense

166
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:06,680
to save the memory inheritance.

167
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,320
Senior, do you know why

168
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:25,000
Tuo Sen wants to capture me ?

169
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:27,800
To borrow your Soul Devourer power

170
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:30,880
to break my Divine Sense seal.

171
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,640
So that's how it is...

172
00:15:34,880 --> 00:15:37,200
How can I leave the Land of the Ancient God ?

173
00:15:37,280 --> 00:15:40,240
Obtain the complete memory inheritance

174
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:44,000
in order to move as you please in my body.

175
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:45,840
Inheritor,

176
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:51,640
you must never let my memory inheritance fall in Tuo Sen's hands.

177
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:56,400
Otherwise, Tuo Sen will become a true Ancient God

178
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:00,560
and all living beings between heaven and earth shall suffer a calamity.

179
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:03,680
Remember... Remember...

180
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:17,840
Don't worry Senior,

181
00:16:18,520 --> 00:16:19,960
I will remember your request.

182
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:28,440
According to Ancient God Tu Si,

183
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:33,000
the complete memory inheritance is buried within this Dead Soul Sea.

184
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,240
So fast, so fast !

185
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:42,200
Master, has your cultivation increased again ?

186
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:44,960
Why don't we go wipe out those old fools ?

187
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:46,720
I'll guard your back !

188
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:51,720
You're overthinking, I just obtained a part of the memory inheritance.

189
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:54,280
So we can't fight Soul Formation old monsters ?

190
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:59,080
Brat...

191
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:01,560
I've finally found you !

192
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:31,760
Master !

193
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:57,040
Master, what was that just now ?

194
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:59,200
How did you dodge that attack ?

195
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:18,480
Core Formation brat, you're looking for death !

196
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:26,600
Didn't you hear Master say he wants this Soul Devourer alive ?

197
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,280
Spare me my Lord...

198
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,280
Spare me my Lord !

199
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:34,880
Interesting...

200
00:18:39,280 --> 00:21:01,320
A constitution is an innate aptitude of a person's body. Typical constitutions are for example affinity with Yin or Yang, affinity with a particular element. Here the Six Desires Devil Lord had a constitution for desires.\N\NAn inner demon in cultivation is an inner entity that is born out of emotions and obsessions in contradiction with the cultivator's Dao Heart. The Dao Heart is the personal belief and interpretation of the Dao.\N\NAncient God inheritances are very rare because they can only form when an Ancient God pays his life as the price. Tu Si was a pretty "young" Ancient God and he tried to cultivate a spell by sacrificing all his lifespan and splitting his Divine Sense but he died and formed an inheritance. Tuo Sen was split from Tu Si during this process and he's the reason why Tu Si failed and died.\N\NAmong the memories Wang Lin inherited, there was a way to traverse the Ancient God's body through the meridians (as portrayed in the end of the episode).\N\NThe process of birth of Ancient Gods is also further explained in the novel (it's just lore, read it if you want):\N\NThe giant sat cross-legged on a star with his hands together, forming a seal. He moved his right hand and one of the stars in the distance exploded, releasing a terrifying blast.\NThe giant didn’t care at all. A stream of golden liquid flew from the exploded star to the giant’s right hand. Shortly after, the giant rubbed his chest and a colorful light came out. After the light disappeared, a normal sized baby appeared in the giant’s hand.\NHe gave the baby a cold look. His right hand pinched the golden liquid and dripped it onto the baby, then he stood up and threw the baby toward a planet.\NSuddenly, the golden liquid surrounded the baby. It moved like a golden meteor and quickly slammed into the planet. The speed was very fast and the impact was great. It wasn’t until it was close to the center of the planet that it slowed down.\NShortly after, the giant didn’t even give the baby other look and disappeared. But suddenly, one day, after countless years of slumber, the baby opened up his eyes. The golden liquid around him rapidly shrunk. The golden liquid was absorbed by the baby as it started to grow older.\NWhat happened next was a calamity. Wang Lin watched as the baby grew into a child. With one movement from the child, all the plants on the planet died and turned into green liquid that flew into the core of the planet to be absorbed by the child. All the spiritual energy was absorbed by the youth. His body grew a lot bigger.\NMany years later, the entire planet became a dead planet. Then, the youth suddenly moved and the entire planet exploded. In the middle of the exploded planet, the youth walked out. He was thousands of feet tall and his eyes were cold, without any emotion.\NThe child had his eyes closed. He seemed to be searching for something with his divine sense. After a long time, he muttered to himself “My name is Tu Si!”

201
00:21:01,520 --> 00:21:11,160
I vow to break

202
00:21:03,320 --> 00:21:11,160
this chess game of fate.
